  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-07-30T09:00:00-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, July 30, 2020, 9:00 am\">July 30, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"em em-view-container\" id=\"em-view-6\">\n\t<div class=\"em pixelbones em-item em-item-single em-event em-event-single em-event-200 \" id=\"em-event-6\">\n\t\t<div></div>\n<p>\n\t<strong>Date/Time</strong><br />\n\tDate(s) - 07/30/2020<br /><i>9:00 am</i>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t<strong>Categories</strong>\n\t\t</p><ul class=\"event-categories\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/archive/source-7720658c45fafb17d541/\">En Plein Air Painting</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/archive/source-b5a8fd6245d54271c682/\">Thursday Open Paint</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\n<p></p>\n<br />\n<p>Considering we are not able to be in close groups; I am encouraging you to paint outside with our Thursday en plein air group! The outdoors is the best teacher for perspective, color, light, and shadows. I’m such a fair-weather painter I need a push, maybe you do too! Weather and parking impact each week’s time and location. To be added to my mailing list, <a href=\"mailto:68chrisbanks@gmail.com\">email today</a>. <em>– Chris Banks</em></p>\n<p>This event is free and open to the public.</p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-5295\" src=\"/media/archive/19796be1913127237d006436db14541a74ec460039c9c72add8c22be779409dc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
